Recommends: multipath-tools
Description: Proxmox VE storage plugin for Dell PowerStore
 Provides native iSCSI block storage integration between Proxmox VE clusters
 and Dell PowerStore appliances. Volumes are created on-demand via the
 PowerStore REST API and presented as raw block devices.
 .
 Features include per-node host registration, volume lifecycle management,
 appliance-layer snapshots, volume cloning, snapshot rollback, and CHAP
 authentication support.
